# Signing material must never be committable, whatever it is called. The repo is
# going PUBLIC, so a mistaken `git add` here is a disclosure rather than an
# embarrassment — these patterns are the cheap half of preventing that.
*.p8
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
*.keychain
*.keychain-db
AuthKey_*
*.key
developerID.*
.env
.env.*
*.base64
